					"nextDialogs": [
						761430598
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430598,
					"content": "…这里是…号…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761430599
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430599,
					"content": "…已接收…讯息…并向你…答复…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431201
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431201,
					"content": "…因为无法准确定位坐标…不知需要多久…回讯才能抵达你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431202,
					"content": "…但我想要…在此时此刻…应答…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431203,
					"content": "…我们是在宇宙间…孤独穿行许久的旅者…而你们的声音…就像黑暗森林中突然燃起的篝火…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431204,
					"content": "…这很冒险…却又无畏…让我们感到振奋与温暖…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431205,
					"content": "…我相信…这个时刻…是星海与命运的引力…将你我连接在一起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431206,
					"content": "…未来…我们会尝试…寻找你们…星球…但很遗憾不是现在…因为还有一些…的麻烦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431207,
					"content": "（…一阵干扰的杂音…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431208,
					"content": "#…{M#哥哥！好了吗？}{F#荧，怎么样了？}",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431209,
					"content": "#…{M#荧，马上来}{F#哥哥，马上好}…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431210,
					"content": "（…一阵干扰的杂音…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431211,
					"content": "…那么…向你致意…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431212,
					"content": "…就像你说的，星海广阔无垠，我们并不孤单…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761431213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761431213,
					"content": "…愿我们有天能在星空下再见…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "终端"
				},
				{
					"id": 761430566,
					"content": "我向所有的你们致意。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
